  "body": "this is typically a sign that metrics will not be reported correctly:\r\n\r\n```\r\n2022-08-26 11:49:42,388 - synapse.metrics - 117 - WARNING - sentinel - synapse_rate_limit_sleep_affected_hosts already registered, reregistering\r\n2022-08-26 11:49:42,388 - synapse.metrics - 117 - WARNING - sentinel - synapse_rate_limit_reject_affected_hosts already registered, reregistering\r\n```\r\n\r\nThese things were added in ~~#13534~~ https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/13541.\r\n",
